{
  "en": {
    "ROB_ULTRON_BODY_NAME": "HEL-P",
    "ROB_ULTRON_BODY_SUBTITLE": "Mildly Confused Helper",
    "ROB_ULTRON_BODY_LORE": "''Yeah, but why a dinky little healing drone?''\r\n\r\nA pile of scraps sits scattered on the bench, with the barest hint of organization. Two men in grease-covered overalls, stuffed to the brim with hand tools, preside over it.\r\n\r\n''Compact, agile, and it's already got all the ports on the mobo I need to interface all the new parts.''\r\n\r\n''This thing is ancient tech, man. I don't care how much you upgrade it, this is turd polishing.''\r\n\r\n''Just you wait til I get done with this baby. Watch and learn.''\r\n\r\n''There's no way this is gonna work...''\r\n\r\nScrews and wires fly as more modules and components are roughly patched into the drone's systems. \r\n\r\n''Voila! Now just to fire 'er up and see how she runs!''\r\n\r\nThe drone's headlights flicker and fade, and the tech swiftly knocks it with the heel of his hand. It comes to life and floats into the air above the table.\r\n\r\n''Welcome to the world, HEL-P! You're here to save lives and protect our crew.''\r\n\r\nThe drone beeps in acknowledgement.\r\n\r\n''Run weapons tests.''\r\n\r\nThe drone beeps, and a gooseneck arm snakes out of the drone's rear panel. Three claw-like appendages unfold and shudder as it amasses energy. Suddenly, a laser erupts from the arm, blasting a hole in the whiteboard behind the two technicians.\r\n\r\n''Woah! You sure that kinda power delivery is safe for this little thing?''\r\n\r\n''Just you wait, it gets better. HEL-P, command override IMPERATIVE: PATCH!''\r\n\r\nThe drone beeps, and flicks its arm towards the two techs, sending out two miniscule drones. The drones gently land on each of their shoulders, emitting a small green aura.\r\n\r\n''Holy crap, how did you get that module to fit onboard?\r\n\r\n''With enough spare parts, a RAM upgrade, and a little know-how, you can make these old things do plenty. That's not even the best part, though. HEL-P, execute Kona Protocol!''\r\n\r\nAnother beep of acknowledgement, and a port rotates open on the underside of the drone, dispensing a dark liquid into the tech's now-empty mug.\r\n\r\n''...Is that a coffee maker?''",
    "DYNAMIC FLIGHT": "Dynamic Flight",
    "HEL-P IS ABLE TO <style=cIsUtility>FLY FREELY</style>, BUT IS <style=cIsHealth>EXTREMELY FRAGILE</style>.": "HEL-P can <style=cIsUtility>FLY FREELY</style>, but is <style=cIsHealth>EXTREMELY FRAGILE</style>.",
    "ENCEPHALO-RAY": "Encephalo-Ray",
    "UNLEASH A BURNING ENERGY BEAM THAT DEALS <style=cIsDamage>350% DAMAGE</style>, ENDING IN AN <style=cIsUtility>EXPLOSION</style> DEALING <style=cIsDamage>500% DAMAGE</style>.": "Unleash a burning energy beam dealing <style=cIsDamage>350% DAMAGE</style>, ending in an <style=cIsUtility>EXPLOSION</style> dealing <style=cIsDamage>500% DAMAGE</style>.",
    "REPULSOR BLAST": "Repulsor Blast",
    "FIRE NANO PULSE CANNONS THAT <style=cIsHealth>HARM HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> AND <style=cIsHealing>HEAL FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> FOR <style=cIsDamage>220%</style>.": "Fire nano pulse cannons that deal <style=cIsDamage>220% damage</style> to hostile combatants and <style=cIsHealing>heal friendly combatants for 220% of your damage</style>.",
    "IMPERATIVE: PATCH": "Imperative: Patch",
    "TARGET AN <style=cIsUtility>ENTITY</style> TO DEPLOY A <style=cIsUtility>DRONE</style> TO THEM. ENEMIES SUFFER A CHAINING <style=cIsDamage>ELECTRIC SHOCK FOR <style=cIsDamage>100% DAMAGE</style>, WHILE ALLIES <style=cIsHealing>HEAL 25% MAX HEALTH</style>.": "Target an <style=cIsUtility>ENTITY</style> to deploy a <style=cIsUtility>DRONE</style> to them. Enemies suffer a chaining <style=cIsDamage>ELECTRIC SHOCK</style> for <style=cIsDamage>100% DAMAGE</style>, while allies <style=cIsHealing>HEAL 25% MAX HEALTH</style>. The final pulse deals or heals three times as much.",
    "IMPERATIVE: NEUTRALIZE": "Imperative: Neutralize",
    "ZAP A HOSTILE COMBATANT TO <style=cIsUtility>SHOCK</style> THEM FOR <style=cIsDamage>30%</style> DAMAGE. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 2 CHARGES.</style>": "Zap a hostile combatant to <style=cIsUtility>SHOCK</style> them for <style=cIsDamage>30%</style> DAMAGE. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 2 CHARGES.</style>",
    "IMPERATIVE: FLEE": "Imperative: Flee",
    "DASH, GAINING <style=cIsHealing>25% BARRIER</style>, AND THEN ENTER AN <style=cIsUtility>ACCELERATED</style> STATE FOR THE NEXT <style=cIsDamage>7 SECONDS</style>.": "Dash, gaining <style=cIsHealing>25% BARRIER</style>, and then enter an <style=cIsUtility>ACCELERATED</style> state for the next <style=cIsDamage>7 SECONDS</style>.",
