    "FIRE A BARRAGE OF ENERGY THAT <style=cIsHealth>HARMS HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> AND <style=cIsHealing>HEALS FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> FOR <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 3 CHARGES.</style>": "Fire a barrage of energy that <style=cIsHealth>HARMS HOSTILE COMBATANTS</style> and <style=cIsHealing>HEALS FRIENDLY COMBATANTS</style> for <style=cIsDamage>5x800%</style>. <style=cIsUtility>HOLD UP TO 3 CHARGES.</style>",
